    {
      "id": "6Avl7xlrbA2Mc9APSqWhh",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1246.6654561018206,
      "y": 7061.092078916456,
      "width": 967.106201171875,
      "height": 1440,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1280000725,
      "version": 341,
      "versionNonce": 491342773,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788078855699,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS\n\n    * Search events by title, city, date\n    * View event details (description, language, duration, cast)\n    * View shows for an event (venue, screen, time, price)\n    * View seat map of a show (layout + live status)\n    * Reserve seats (temporary hold, 5 min)\n    * Pay and confirm booking\n    * View my bookings\n\n2. NON-FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS\n\n    * CAP Theorem: Consistency for booking ticket seats and payment (no double booking). High availability for Search and View flows.\n    * Scale & Assumptions:\n    * DAU: 100M\n    * Bookings per day: 1M (1% of DAU)\n    * Read actions per user: 10\n    * Seat Lock duration: 5 minutes\n    * Peak factor: 10x average\n    * Read QPS: 10k QPS average, 100k QPS peak\n    * Write QPS: 10 QPS average, 100 QPS peak\n    * Read-to-Write Ratio: 1000:1\n    * Storage: 1M booking rows/day * 1000 bytes = 365 GB storage per year\n\n\n\n3. API SPECIFICATIONS\n    SEARCH\n        Endpoint: GET /v1/search?q=java&city=Pune&date=2026-05-11&limit=20&cursor=\n        Response 200: [ events: [{eventId, title, poster, language, rating}], nextCursor ]\n        Cache: 5 minutes\n    \n    EVENT DETAILS\n        Endpoint: GET /v1/events/{eventId}\n        Response 200: [ id, title, description, language, durationMin, cast, poster ]\n        Cache: 1 hour (no shows, no seats)\n    \n    SHOWS OF AN EVENT\n        Endpoint: GET /v1/events/{eventId}/shows?city=Pune&date=2026-05-11\n        Response 200: [ { showId, venueName, screenName, startTimestamp, basePrice, seatsLeft } ]\n        Cache: 1 minute (seatsLeft is eventual, not truth)\n    \n    SEAT MAP\n        Endpoint: GET /v1/shows/{showId}/seats\n        Response 200: [ showId, screen, seats: [{ticketId, row, num, type, price, status}] ]\n        Status Values: AVAILABLE | HELD | SOLD\n        Behavior: Lazy expiry append, no cache\n\n    RESERVE (lock, 5 min)\n        Endpoint: POST /v1/bookings\n        Headers:\n        Authorization: Bearer  (userId extracted from token, never request body)\n        Idempotency-Key: \n        Body: { \"showId\": \"sh_101\", \"ticketIds\": [\"T1\", \"T2\"] }\n        Response 201: { \"bookingId\": \"bk_123\", \"status\": \"PENDING\", \"amount\": 800, \"expiresAt\": 1778500300 }\n        Response 409: { \"error\": \"SEATS_TAKEN\", \"failedIds\": [\"T1\"] }\n\n    CONFIRM (after payment)\n        Endpoint: POST /v1/bookings/{bookingId}/confirm\n        Headers:\n        Idempotency-Key: \n        Body: { \"paymentToken\": \"tok_123\" }\n        Response 200: { \"bookingId\": \"bk_123\", \"status\": \"CONFIRMED\", \"tickets\": [\"T1\", \"T2\"] }\n        Response 410: { \"error\": \"LOCK_EXPIRED\" }\n    \n    RELEASE (user cancel/exit)\n        Endpoint: DELETE /v1/bookings/{bookingId}\n        Response: 204 No Content\n    \n    MY BOOKINGS\n        Endpoint: GET /v1/bookings?status=CONFIRMED\n        Response 200: [ { \"bookingId\": \"bk_123\", \"showId\": \"sh_101\", \"seats\": [\"T1\", \"T2\"], \"amount\": 800, \"status\": \"CONFIRMED\" } ]",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS\n\n    * Search events by title, city, date\n    * View event details (description, language, duration, cast)\n    * View shows for an event (venue, screen, time, price)\n    * View seat map of a show (layout + live status)\n    * Reserve seats (temporary hold, 5 min)\n    * Pay and confirm booking\n    * View my bookings\n\n2. NON-FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS\n\n    * CAP Theorem: Consistency for booking ticket seats and payment (no double booking). High availability for Search and View flows.\n    * Scale & Assumptions:\n    * DAU: 100M\n    * Bookings per day: 1M (1% of DAU)\n    * Read actions per user: 10\n    * Seat Lock duration: 5 minutes\n    * Peak factor: 10x average\n    * Read QPS: 10k QPS average, 100k QPS peak\n    * Write QPS: 10 QPS average, 100 QPS peak\n    * Read-to-Write Ratio: 1000:1\n    * Storage: 1M booking rows/day * 1000 bytes = 365 GB storage per year\n\n\n\n3. API SPECIFICATIONS\n    SEARCH\n        Endpoint: GET /v1/search?q=java&city=Pune&date=2026-05-11&limit=20&cursor=\n        Response 200: [ events: [{eventId, title, poster, language, rating}], nextCursor ]\n        Cache: 5 minutes\n    \n    EVENT DETAILS\n        Endpoint: GET /v1/events/{eventId}\n        Response 200: [ id, title, description, language, durationMin, cast, poster ]\n        Cache: 1 hour (no shows, no seats)\n    \n    SHOWS OF AN EVENT\n        Endpoint: GET /v1/events/{eventId}/shows?city=Pune&date=2026-05-11\n        Response 200: [ { showId, venueName, screenName, startTimestamp, basePrice, seatsLeft } ]\n        Cache: 1 minute (seatsLeft is eventual, not truth)\n    \n    SEAT MAP\n        Endpoint: GET /v1/shows/{showId}/seats\n        Response 200: [ showId, screen, seats: [{ticketId, row, num, type, price, status}] ]\n        Status Values: AVAILABLE | HELD | SOLD\n        Behavior: Lazy expiry append, no cache\n\n    RESERVE (lock, 5 min)\n        Endpoint: POST /v1/bookings\n        Headers:\n        Authorization: Bearer  (userId extracted from token, never request body)\n        Idempotency-Key: \n        Body: { \"showId\": \"sh_101\", \"ticketIds\": [\"T1\", \"T2\"] }\n        Response 201: { \"bookingId\": \"bk_123\", \"status\": \"PENDING\", \"amount\": 800, \"expiresAt\": 1778500300 }\n        Response 409: { \"error\": \"SEATS_TAKEN\", \"failedIds\": [\"T1\"] }\n\n    CONFIRM (after payment)\n        Endpoint: POST /v1/bookings/{bookingId}/confirm\n        Headers:\n        Idempotency-Key: \n        Body: { \"paymentToken\": \"tok_123\" }\n        Response 200: { \"bookingId\": \"bk_123\", \"status\": \"CONFIRMED\", \"tickets\": [\"T1\", \"T2\"] }\n        Response 410: { \"error\": \"LOCK_EXPIRED\" }\n    \n    RELEASE (user cancel/exit)\n        Endpoint: DELETE /v1/bookings/{bookingId}\n        Response: 204 No Content\n    \n    MY BOOKINGS\n        Endpoint: GET /v1/bookings?status=CONFIRMED\n        Response 200: [ { \"bookingId\": \"bk_123\", \"showId\": \"sh_101\", \"seats\": [\"T1\", \"T2\"], \"amount\": 800, \"status\": \"CONFIRMED\" } ]",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
