    {
      "id": "EZcATsM9JtPkJAeNSjrFg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2646.035212606997,
      "y": 8135.781936507662,
      "width": 380.0131382562101,
      "height": 417.3291734923373,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0s",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 855609595,
      "version": 2401,
      "versionNonce": 675162109,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "rPmU3w9xkOZ-pMP6LTQZg",
          "type": "arrow"
        },
        {
          "id": "zZwPnlAdvdJR6EpIQdxWQ",
          "type": "arrow"
        },
        {
          "id": "lmqDD0oZ7g5_zPH5WqLF3",
          "type": "arrow"
        },
        {
          "id": "1CDy5-PpbPMLlyzvx5iIf",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1788199448636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Booking svc\n- user will see first in redis seat avilability \n then move to db to check\n\nOnce available \n- Reserve seat in redis+ db\n   - SET NX seat: <show>:<seat> TTL 4 m \n   - SET status='LOCKED', locked_by=u, lock_expiry=now()+5min\n      WHERE id IN (ids) AND (status='AVAILABLE' OR lock_expiry < now())\n\n- if payment success\n  - update ticket to BOOKED only if lock not expired as till the time \n      user payment was done another user already booked or the lock expired\n  - lock expired already rollback and refund (saga compensation)\n  - lock valid good booking CONFIRMED + outbox event ( notify user)\n  - delete redis seat key\n\n- if payment failed\n  - ticket back to AVAILABLE, booking FAILED\n  - delete redis seat key\n\nrefund\n  - call gateway refund with idempotency key\n  - on failure retry with backoff\n  - still failing -> refunds_pending table -> cron -> alert human\n- (outbox pattern) publish to topic booking.confirmed \n \n- Has a cron job which do refund stuck payments \n\n  - User can see the View Seat ",
      "fontSize": 11.128777959795661,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Booking svc\n- user will see first in redis seat avilability \n then move to db to check\n\nOnce available \n- Reserve seat in redis+ db\n   - SET NX seat: <show>:<seat> TTL 4 m \n   - SET status='LOCKED', locked_by=u, lock_expiry=now()+5min\n      WHERE id IN (ids) AND (status='AVAILABLE' OR lock_expiry < now())\n\n- if payment success\n  - update ticket to BOOKED only if lock not expired as till the time \n      user payment was done another user already booked or the lock expired\n  - lock expired already rollback and refund (saga compensation)\n  - lock valid good booking CONFIRMED + outbox event ( notify user)\n  - delete redis seat key\n\n- if payment failed\n  - ticket back to AVAILABLE, booking FAILED\n  - delete redis seat key\n\nrefund\n  - call gateway refund with idempotency key\n  - on failure retry with backoff\n  - still failing -> refunds_pending table -> cron -> alert human\n- (outbox pattern) publish to topic booking.confirmed \n \n- Has a cron job which do refund stuck payments \n\n  - User can see the View Seat ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
